This standalone project adapts literature-connector concepts and selected parsing,
normalization, and HTTP-reliability patterns from the OpenScience project. It has
been rewritten for Node.js, the Model Context Protocol SDK, deterministic
multi-source aggregation, and independent operation. It does not import or depend
on the OpenScience runtime.

The Apache License 2.0 text was copied from the OpenScience distribution.
